  "name": "Bless Army (Su)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Channel Energy class feature</p><p>A cleric can raise his holy symbol high and give a blessing to the army he is leading. The cleric's army gains a +1 bonus to the army's attack rolls and AC. This is a sacred bonus if the cleric is good-aligned and it is a profane bonus if the cleric is evil-aligned. Using this ability requires the cleric to expend two uses of her channel energy ability. This bonus lasts for 1 battle, and it must be performed during the first round of the battle.</p>",
